✅ 100+ problems (Linear Algebra, ML, Deep Learning, NLP, CV)
✅ Free interview prep (DS & MLE roles)
✅ Collections: Transformers, ResNet, AlexNet, etc.
✅ Community-driven & constantly updated
✅ Jobs section + Creator program (earn by contributing)

🎉 Why This Beats LeetCode:
→ Made by ML pros, not generic coders
→ Problems you actually use in ML work
→ Modern topics (DeepSeek, LLM evaluation)
→ Leaderboards + Daily challenges

🙋 Perfect for: ML interview prep, building fundamentals, staying updated on architectures

